send.com/changelog/email-metrics-api" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" style="color:#0670DB;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">an entire headless analytics API</a> that&#x27;s extensible so we can continue to add additional metrics to fit your needs. </p><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em;text-align:left">And don&#x27;t forget our first-ever conference, <a href="https://resend.com/forward" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" style="color:rgb(6, 112, 219);text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank"><u>Resend Forward</u></a>, is quickly approaching.</p><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em;text-align:left">Quick question:</p><blockquote style="border-left:3px solid #acb3be;color:#7e8a9a;margin-left:0;padding-left:0.8em;font-size:1.1em;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, &#x27;Roboto&#x27;, &#x27;Oxygen&#x27;, &#x27;Ubuntu&#x27;, &#x27;Cantarell&#x27;, &#x27;Fira Sans&#x27;, &#x27;Droid Sans&#x27;, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif"><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em;text-align:left"><strong>What feature should we put on our roadmap?</strong></p></blockquote><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em;text-align:left">Just hit reply. We read every answer.</p><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em;text-align:left"><br/></p><h2 style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1.8em;line-height:1.44em;padding-top:0.389em;font-weight:600">3 Domains for all</h2><a href="https://resend.com/changelog/three-domains-on-the-free-tier" style="color:#067df7;text-decoration-line:none" target="_blank"><img alt="A dark, abstract sphere with concentric rings is shown behind the text &quot;More Domains on the Free Tier&quot; and a small &quot;Changelog&quot; button" src="https://resend-attachments.s3.amazonaws.com/e304e589-b04c-42e8-9316-a61012ce2430" style="display:block;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none;max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;height:auto" width="100%"/></a><p class="node-paragraph" style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em">The free tier now includes 3 verified domains, so you can build and send from more projects without upgrading. Every free team can now verify up to three domains, in any region, at no cost.</p><p class="node-paragraph" style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em"><a href="https://resend.com/changelog/three-domains-on-the-free-tier" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" style="color:#0670DB;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank"><u>→ Read the changelog</u></a></p><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em"><br/></p><h2 style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1.8em;line-height:1.44em;padding-top:0.389em;font-weight:600">Headless email analytics</h2><a href="https://resend.com/changelog/email-metrics-api" style="color:#067df7;text-decoration-line:none" target="_blank"><img alt="A screenshot shows the &quot;Email Metrics API&quot; title with code snippets and programming language options like Node.js, PHP, and Python." src="https://resend-attachments.s3.amazonaws.com/5e391595-81b5-4a4e-a7fe-eb33670c554f" style="display:block;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none;max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;height:auto" width="100%"/></a><p class="node-paragraph" style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em">Get data about your emails, from the send volume to unsubscribe rate, grouped or filtered by the period, domain, broadcast, or email.</p><p class="node-paragraph" style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em"><a href="https://resend.com/changelog/email-metrics-api" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" style="color:rgb(6, 112, 219);text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank"><u>→ Try the new Metrics API</u></a></p><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em"><br/></p><h2 style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1.8em;line-height:1.44em;padding-top:0.389em;font-weight:600">A new way to verify your email</h2><a href="https://resend.com/blog/email-verification-api" style="color:#067df7;text-decoration-line:none" target="_blank"><img class="node-image" alt="A dark screen displays the text &quot;Email Verification API&quot; with a &quot;Guide&quot; button above it, and a tablet showing a &quot;Success!&quot; message below" src="https://resend-attachments.s3.amazonaws.com/41faf4a2-6586-4825-99ca-5771578a2067" style="display:block;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none;max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;height:auto" width="100%"/></a><p class="node-paragraph" style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em">A new proposal aims to enable email verification directly within the browser. We covered all the details, and built a library for you to try it out.</p><p class="node-paragraph" style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em"><a href="https://resend.com/blog/email-verification-api" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" style="color:rgb(6, 112, 219);text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank"><u>→ Read the blog post</u></a></p><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em;text-align:left"><br/></p><h2 style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1.8em;line-height:1.44em;padding-top:0.389em;font-weight:600">Resend now supports Agent Plugins</h2><a href="https://resend.com/changelog/agent-plugins-standard" style="color:#067df7;text-decoration-line:none" target="_blank"><img alt="A diagram illustrates the structure of an agent plugin with files like plugin.json, skills, and mcp.json." src="https://resend-attachments.s3.amazonaws.com/2f691d6e-49b5-4b44-b51c-d8a2298cf789" style="display:block;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none;max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;height:auto" width="100%"/></a><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em">Resend Skills added support for the Agent Plugins Standard, an open, vendor-neutral standard for packaging skills and MCP servers into a portable plugin.</p><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em"><a href="https://resend.com/changelog/agent-plugins-standard" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" style="color:#0670DB;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">→ Check the guide</a></p><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em"><br/></p><h2 style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1.8em;line-height:1.44em;padding-top:0.389em;font-weight:600">Manage your own suppressions</h2><a href="https://resend.com/changelog/suppression-list-support" style="color:#067df7;text-decoration-line:none" target="_blank"><img class="node-image" alt="A screenshot displays a &quot;Suppressions&quot; list with email addresses and their origins, alongside a &quot;Changelog&quot; section with the title &quot;Suppression" src="https://resend-attachments.s3.amazonaws.com/67fdd3e9-fabf-475d-9dcf-a135bb50a8ef" style="display:block;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none;max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;height:auto" width="100%"/></a><p class="node-paragraph" style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em">Spam complaints and hard bounces can wreck your sending reputation, which is why Resend has always suppressed those addresses behind the scenes. Now you can see, manage, and automate your suppression list yourself. Here&#x27;s how the new tools work.</p><p class="node-paragraph" style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em"><a href="https://resend.com/changelog/suppression-list-support" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" style="color:rgb(6, 112, 219);text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank"><u>→ Learn more about Suppressions</u></a></p><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em"><br/></p><h2 style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1.8em;line-height:1.44em;padding-top:0.389em;font-weight:600">Resend supports the new MCP spec</h2><a href="https://resend.com/changelog/resend-mcp-supports-the-new-2026-07-28-spec" style="color:#067df7;text-decoration-line:none" target="_blank"><img alt="A dark, square icon with a white, stylized &quot;m&quot; logo is displayed on a black background, with the text &quot;Support for the New MCP" src="https://resend-attachments.s3.amazonaws.com/083d6938-6a73-4bdb-8d87-51e6da99fe4f" style="display:block;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none;max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;height:auto" width="100%"/></a><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em">The MCP specification just released a major upgrade, and now Resend&#x27;s remote MCP server supports this latest version.</p><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em"><a href="https://resend.com/changelog/resend-mcp-supports-the-new-2026-07-28-spec" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" style="color:#0670DB;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">→ Read the changelog</a></p><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em"><br/></p><div style="margin:0;padding:0"><div style="margin:0;padding:0"><div style="margin:0;padding:0"><div style="margin:0;padding:0"><h2 style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1.8em;line-height:1.44em;padding-top:0.389em;font-weight:600">A full video tour</h2><a href="https://youtu.be/FzoakVwRm2Q" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="youtube youtubeContent"><img class="node-image" alt="YouTube video" src="https://resend-attachments.s3.amazonaws.com/c94239eb-ac62-4334-a1f4-0b58a22258e8" style="display:block;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none;margin:0;padding:0;max-width:100%;border-radius:8px" width="100%"/><div data-node-view-content="" style="white-space:pre-wrap"></div></a></div></div><div style="margin:0;padding:0"><div style="margin:0;padding:0"><div style="margin:0;padding:0"><div style="margin:0;padding:0"><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="max-width:600px;align:center;width:100%;border-radius:0px;line-height:155%"><tbody><tr style="width:100%"><td style="padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px"><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em">Take a full tour of Resend, the email API built for developers. In under 8 minutes, see how to authenticate your domain, send transactional and marketing emails, build automations, and debug with full observability, all from the dashboard, API, SDKs, CLI, or MCP.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div></div></div><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em"><a href="http://youtube.com/watch?v=FzoakVwRm2Q" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" style="color:#0670DB;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">→ Watch the video</a></p><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em"><br/></p><h2 style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1.8em;line-height:1.44em;padding-top:0.389em;font-weight:600">For builders who care</h2><a href="https://forward.resend.com/register/discount/RESEND-USER" style="color:#067df7;text-decoration-line:none" target="_blank"><img class="node-image" alt="Resend Forward. An event for builders. Oct 21, 2026. San Francisco." src="https://resend-attachments.s3.amazonaws.com/91e37ba1-aa47-4889-89a9-22f123baa8e7" style="display:block;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none;max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;height:auto" width="100%"/></a><p class="node-paragraph" style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em">It&#x27;s easier than ever to make software, fast. Today, true artisans are differentiated on their attention to detail.</p><p class="node-paragraph" style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em">We&#x27;re hosting a conference to gather builders who still care about their craft. Those who:</p><ul style="margin:0;padding:0;padding-left:1.1em;padding-bottom:1em"><li style="margin:0;padding:0;margin-left:1em;padding-bottom:0.3em;padding-top:0.3em"><p style="margin:0;padding:0">Lose sleep over an abstraction</p></li><li style="margin:0;padding:0;margin-left:1em;padding-bottom:0.3em;padding-top:0.3em"><p style="margin:0;padding:0">Tweak designs pixel-by-pixel</p></li><li style="margin:0;padding:0;margin-left:1em;padding-bottom:0.3em;padding-top:0.3em"><p style="margin:0;padding:0">Spend time fixing things most will never notice</p></li></ul><p class="node-paragraph" style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em">Resend Forward takes place October 21, 2026 in San Francisco. </p><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em">Since you&#x27;re a user, we&#x27;ve set aside a reduced rate for you.</p><p class="node-paragraph" style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em"><a href="https://forward.resend.com/register/discount/RESEND-USER" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" style="color:#0670DB;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:auto">→ Attend Forward</span></a></p><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em"><br/></p><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em;text-align:left">Happy sending,<br/>Zeno Rocha</p><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" class="footer" style="font-size:0.8em"><tbody><tr><td><hr class="divider" style="width:100%;border:none;border-color:transparent;border-top:1px solid #eaeaea;padding-bottom:1em;border-style:solid;border-width:0;border-top-width:2px"/><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em;text-align:left">You are receiving this email as a user of Resend.<br/><br/>Want to change how you receive these emails?<br/>You can <a href="https://unsubscribe.resend.com/?token=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJjb250YWN0SWQiOiJhODA1YjkzNC0zZWM1LTRkNGMtYmRkMC05Yjc1YzVhYzhkM2IiLCJhdWRpZW5jZUlkIjoiMzViMWNmZjEtYzM4MS00ZDZmLTk5NGUtNDkwNGY4NTVmMmM3IiwiYnJvYWRjYXN0SWQiOiJjN2U5ZDk0My1hYWYwLTQzMDQtYWUwYi1jMWI3MzVlYWFhNjQiLCJ0ZWFtSWQiOiI0MGI0OGMwOS0xYmYxLTRkNjItYWYyOS03YzE2MTNkMmVkNzUiLCJleHAiOjE4MTk4MTQyMTR9.uVzeOoUagbM6Plc_5qGlFLPlZyv4H5mEHg13ilVH2uc" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" style="color:#0670DB;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">unsubscribe from this list</a>.</p><p style="margin:0;padding:0;font-size:1em;padding-top:0.5em;padding-bottom:0.5em;text-align:left">2261 Market Street #5039<br/><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0)">San Francisco, CA 94114</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
